  graphics = {
    capabilities = [ "graphics" ];   # only apply to hosts declaring this
    homeManager = {
      # e.g. enable a compositor, GPU-related options
    };
  };
}
```

and on the host side:

```nix
hosts = {
  laptop = {
    capabilities = [ "graphics" "battery" ];
  };
  server = {
    capabilities = [ ];
  };
};
```

If your version of den doesn't have built-in capability filtering on aspects, the fallback is to condition the aspect's body on the host's capabilities at apply time (e.g. `if hasCapability host "graphics" then { ... } else { }`), but I could not confirm which of the two your den rev supports.

